{"unit_id":"tag:06KR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的极小的（minimal）光滑的（smooth）前可表的（prorepresentable）函子群胚（groupoids in functors）。若<MATH_0004>是群胚余纤维范畴（categories cofibered in groupoids）的等价（equivalence），则<MATH_0005>是同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"前可表的"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚"},{"source_term":"categories cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"群胚余纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的","context":"群胚极小性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"群胚光滑性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"前可表的","context":"群胚前可表性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚","context":"给定群胚；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"categories cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"群胚余纤维范畴","context":"等价的范畴类型；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"商范畴间的等价；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"等价的同构性；术语未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06KR:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的拟逆（quasi-inverse）。则<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphisms），由引理<REF_0001>得出，因此<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>是同构（isomorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆","context":"给定等价的拟逆；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"复合与原态射的同构性；术语未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
